            "typeName": "dsDescription",
            "multiple": true,
            "typeClass": "compound",
            "value": [
              {
                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p dir=\"ltr\">TThis tool presents a selection of competences that are relevant for societal impact. \nThe content is presented as a non-exhaustive list of competences that academics can develop for \nimpact-oriented academic activities. Alongside each competence and its definition, we highlight \nits relevance to societal impact and suggest potential assessment indicators.</p>\n\n<p></p>\n\n<p>This tool is part of a trilogy. Each tool focusses on different components of how staff can \nbe impactful. This tool serves as a reflective tool on how to build an impactful careers and \nimpact identities, the Impact Competences Catalogue shares relevant impactful competences and \nthe Impact Activities Catalogue on impactful activities.</p>"
                }
              }
            ]
